Subject: [PATCH 399/488] Dispatch the penalties and the prompt/output
 histogram to TileLang

Both are bit-exact with the Triton kernels and faster at every timed
shape. The Triton kernels stay as the tests' references; the histogram's
callers still clear the selected rows before it accumulates.
---
 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/sample/penalties.py | 101 ++++---------------------
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 88 deletions(-)

